<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 55 0 R
/E (BoothHub is a centralized web-based management system designed specifically for small business owners and booth service providers \(e.g., coffee booths, photography booths\). The project transforms the traditional, manual booking process into a digital, automated workflow to eliminate scheduling conflicts and improve organizational efficiency.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
