<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 55 0 R
/E (The Problem: Small businesses often manage bookings manually via social media or messaging apps. This leads to disorganized requests, difficulty in tracking customer data, and frequent double-booking errors.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
