/P 56 0 R
/E (The BoothHub administrative portal is engineered with a modular architecture where each component is designed to streamline a specific phase of the booking lifecycle. The system moves from secure authentication to real-time data management and strategic decision-making through the following dedicated interfaces:)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
